Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Merged as one issue, but it held two.** The parser reads dates month first, and our tenants
write the day first. Separately, the booking-v3 form tells day-first people to type month first.
Engineering closed #4471 on 5 October: the parser is fixed, booking-v3 is retired.

<Callout>
Closed. Two problems, one ticket each: see <a href="/kb/incidents/4471-split">#4471 · two problems, not one</a>.
</Callout>

